  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports China Council for International Cooperation on Environment and Development (CCICED). CCICED is an interdisciplinary policy research platform advising China&#x2019;s State Council on sustainable management of natural resources within and outside China, and innovation for a better global governance system for environment and sustainable development. It is implemented by China&#x2019;s Ministry of Ecology and Environment.</narrative>
  </description>
